verb roam_timer_clears "The nucleus swims free is over" by world priority 99 in enemy at 2040 150
  take timer_roam
  unless phase_roam

verb recover_timer_clears "The nucleus swims free after a stun is over" by world priority 99 in enemy at 2180 220
  take timer_recover
  unless phase_recover

verb stunned_sword_timer_clears "The nucleus reels from a sword hit is over" by world priority 99 in enemy at 2040 360
